    /// <summary>
    /// By default, a maximum of <c>10</c> listeners can be registered for any single
    /// event. This limit can be changed for individual <c>EventEmitter</c> instances
    /// using the <c>emitter.setMaxListeners(n)</c> method. To change the default
    /// for _all_<c>EventEmitter</c> instances, the <c>events.defaultMaxListeners</c> property
    /// can be used. If this value is not a positive number, a <c>RangeError</c> is thrown.
    /// <br /><br />
