    /// <param name="options">The <c>options</c> argument, if present, is an object used to parameterize the sending of certain types of handles.</param>
    abstract send: message: Serializable * ?sendHandle: SendHandle * ?callback: (exn option -> unit) -> bool
    /// <summary>
    /// Send a message to a worker or primary, optionally with a handle.
