    /// In the primary, this sends a message to a specific worker. It is identical to <a href="https://nodejs.org/docs/latest-v22.x/api/child_process.html#subprocesssendmessage-sendhandle-options-callback"><c>ChildProcess.send()</c></a>.
    /// <br /><br />
