    /// global setting and effectively frozen once either the first worker is spawned, or <a href="https://nodejs.org/docs/latest-v22.x/api/cluster.html#clustersetupprimarysettings"><c>.setupPrimary()</c></a>
    /// is called, whichever comes first.
    /// <br /><br />
    /// <c>SCHED_RR</c> is the default on all operating systems except Windows. Windows will change to <c>SCHED_RR</c> once libuv is able to effectively distribute
    /// IOCP handles without incurring a large performance hit.
    /// <br /><br />
    /// <c>cluster.schedulingPolicy</c> can also be set through the <c>NODE_CLUSTER_SCHED_POLICY</c> environment variable. Valid values are <c>'rr'</c> and <c>'none'</c>.
    /// </summary>
