    /// <br /><br />
    /// A worker is removed from <c>cluster.workers</c> after the worker has disconnected _and_ exited. The order between these two events cannot be determined in advance. However, it
    /// is guaranteed that the removal from the <c>cluster.workers</c> list happens before the last <c>'disconnect'</c> or <c>'exit'</c> event is emitted.
    /// <code lang="js">
    /// import cluster from 'node:cluster';
    ///
    /// for (const worker of Object.values(cluster.workers)) {
    ///   worker.send('big announcement to all workers');
