    /// <summary>
    /// Updates the hash content with the given <c>data</c>, the encoding of which
    /// is given in <c>inputEncoding</c>.
    /// If <c>encoding</c> is not provided, and the <c>data</c> is a string, an
    /// encoding of <c>'utf8'</c> is enforced. If <c>data</c> is a <c>Buffer</c>, <c>TypedArray</c>, or<c>DataView</c>, then <c>inputEncoding</c> is ignored.
