/// <summary>
/// Watch for changes on <c>filename</c>. The callback <c>listener</c> will be called each
/// time the file is accessed.
/// <br /><br />
/// The <c>options</c> argument may be omitted. If provided, it should be an object. The <c>options</c> object may contain a boolean named <c>persistent</c> that indicates
