    /// not be emitted. If <c>--abort-on-uncaught-exception</c> was passed from the
    /// command line or set through <c>v8.setFlagsFromString()</c>, the process will
    /// not abort. Actions configured to take place on exceptions such as report
    /// generations will be affected too
    /// <br /><br />
    /// To unset the capture function, <c>process.setUncaughtExceptionCaptureCallback(null)</c> may be used. Calling this
    /// method with a non-<c>null</c> argument while another capture function is set will
    /// throw an error.
