    /// socket/stream from this function, or by passing the socket/stream to <c>callback</c>.
    /// <br /><br />
    /// This method is guaranteed to return an instance of the <c>net.Socket</c> class,
    /// a subclass of <c>stream.Duplex</c>, unless the user specifies a socket
    /// type other than <c>net.Socket</c>.
    /// <br /><br />
    /// <c>callback</c> has a signature of <c>(err, stream)</c>.
    /// </summary>
    /// <remarks>@since v0.11.4</remarks>
    /// <param name="options">Options containing connection details. Check <c>createConnection</c> for the format of the options</param>
    /// <param name="callback">Callback function that receives the created socket</param>
    abstract createConnection: options: ClientRequestArgs * ?callback: Agent.CreateConnection.Callback -> Duplex option
