    /// This method allows mapping over the stream. The <i>fn</i> function will be called for every chunk in the stream.
    /// If the <i>fn</i> function returns a promise - that promise will be <c>await</c>ed before being passed to the result stream.
    /// </summary>
    /// <remarks>@since v17.4.0, v16.14.0</remarks>
