    /// This method allows filtering the stream. For each chunk in the stream the <i>fn</i> function will be called
    /// and if it returns a truthy value, the chunk will be passed to the result stream.
    /// If the <i>fn</i> function returns a promise - that promise will be <c>await</c>ed.
    /// </summary>
    /// <remarks>@since v17.4.0, v16.14.0</remarks>
