    /// <returns>a stream filtered with the predicate <i>fn</i>.</returns>
    abstract filter: fn: Readable.Filter.Fn * ?options: ArrayOptions -> Readable
    /// <summary>
    /// This method allows iterating a stream. For each chunk in the stream the <i>fn</i> function will be called.
    /// If the <i>fn</i> function returns a promise - that promise will be <c>await</c>ed.
    /// <br /><br />
    /// This method is different from <c>for await...of</c> loops in that it can optionally process chunks concurrently.
    /// In addition, a <c>forEach</c> iteration can only be stopped by having passed a <c>signal</c> option
    /// and aborting the related AbortController while <c>for await...of</c> can be stopped with <c>break</c> or <c>return</c>.
