    /// This method is similar to <c>Array.prototype.find</c> and calls <i>fn</i> on each chunk in the stream
    /// to find a chunk with a truthy value for <i>fn</i>. Once an <i>fn</i> call's awaited return value is truthy,
    /// the stream is destroyed and the promise is fulfilled with value for which <i>fn</i> returned a truthy value.
    /// If all of the <i>fn</i> calls on the chunks return a falsy value, the promise is fulfilled with <c>undefined</c>.
    /// </summary>
