    /// <summary>
    /// The <c>writable.write()</c> method writes some data to the stream, and calls the
    /// supplied <c>callback</c> once the data has been fully handled. If an error
    /// occurs, the <c>callback</c> will be called with the error as its
    /// first argument. The <c>callback</c> is called asynchronously and before <c>'error'</c> is
