/// Instances of <c>tls.TLSSocket</c> implement the duplex <c>Stream</c> interface.
/// <br /><br />
/// Methods that return TLS connection metadata (e.g.TLSSocket.getPeerCertificate) will only return data while the
/// connection is open.
